    "L007: \"ContractCommitmentId MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"ContractCommitmentId MUST be of type String.\"",
    "  L010: \"ContractCommitmentId MUST conform to [StringHandling](#attributes.stringhandling) requirements.\"",
